# Direct dependencies of the fast-lane worker.
# Step 1: RQ harness + data layer. Step 2 (S2.0): detection engines -
# yara-python, the clamd client, and zircolite's runtime deps (zircolite
# itself is a pinned source tarball installed by the Dockerfile, not a pip
# package: no PyPI release, no binary releases). pyyaml is provided by the
# base image and is deliberately not repeated here.
rq
redis
duckdb
pyarrow
yara-python
pyclamd
# zircolite 3.8.1 runtime deps (requirements.txt of the pinned tag, minus
# pyyaml already in base)
chardet
evtx
jinja2
lxml
orjson
psutil
py7zr
pysigma
pysigma-backend-sqlite
pysigma-pipeline-sysmon
pysigma-pipeline-windows
requests
RestrictedPython
rich
rich-argparse
xxhash
